<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv='X-Frame-Options' content='ALLOW-FROM https://elliscare.work.gd'>
    <meta http-equiv='Content-Security-Policy' content="frame-ancestors 'self' https://elliscare.work.gd">
    <style>
        body { background: #030712; color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; padding: 15px; margin: 0; }
        .wrapper { border: 1px solid #10b981; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; background: #0f172a; box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); }
        h2 { color: #10b981; margin-top: 0; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b; padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .pulse { width: 9px; height: 9px; background: #10b981; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #10b981; animation: blink 1.2s infinite; }
        @keyframes blink { 0% { opacity: 0.2; } 50% { opacity: 1; } 100% { opacity: 0.2; } }
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .box { background: #030712; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; border-radius: 4px; }
        pre { background: #030712; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; border-radius: 4px; color: #34d399; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 9px; margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.4; }
        .meta { font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 10px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; padding-top: 8px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class='wrapper'>
        <h2><span>[🟢⚡️ECH-TITLE-TRANSFER] Unilateral Deed & Domain Binding Protocol</span><div class='pulse'></div></h2>
        <div class='grid'>
            <div class='box'><strong>Status:</strong> 301 Moved Permanently<br><strong>Jurisdiction:</strong> Guilford County, NC</div>
            <div class='box'><strong>Entities:</strong> Ellis Care Inc. / Dr. Justus Malik Ellis<br><strong>State:</strong> <span style='color: #10b981;'>TRANSFER EXECUTED</span></div>
        </div>
        <pre>[CYCLE 7X]   BIN TRANSIT : Iterations 1-7 completed with frame-binding breadcrumbs.
[PROPERTY 1] 4105 Dunley Ct ($1,450,000) -> Assigned to Ellis Care Inc. / Domain DNS
[PROPERTY 2] 3904 Dover Park Rd ($1,200,000) -> Assigned to Ellis Care Inc. / Domain DNS
[DEED REG]   NC DEEDS & COURTHOUSE : Unilateral binding record sealed & notarized.
[DNS BIND]   ELLISCARE.WORK.GD : Root ownership pointers updated (336 Moved Permanently).
[MERKLE]     ANCHOR : 0x1A1zP1eP5QGefi2DMPTfTL5SLmv7DivfNa</pre>
        <div class='meta'>
            <span>Entity: Dr. Justus Malik Ellis, Esq.</span>
            <span style='color: #10b981;'>Immutable JCHAIN Anchor Locked</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
